# Private key material, wherever it lands. `age-keygen -o veilio-backup.key`
# writes the private half into the directory you happen to be standing in, and
# on 2026-10-20 that was the root of this repository - mode 600, untracked, and
# one `git add -A` from being published. The key was discarded and regenerated
# outside any repo. These patterns are the belt to that braces: nothing here
# should ever hold a private key, so matching broadly costs nothing.
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
